      "content": "Wait, hold on. You just said there have been \"no reported plumbing concerns or slab defects within the past two years,\" but then in the very next sentence you mentioned \"the last four inspections\" involving \"specialized temporary repairs and ceiling painting\" to address a leak. \n\nThose two statements completely contradict each other. If there were repairs for a leak as recently as the last four inspections, then there *have* been plumbing concerns in the last two years. \n\nWhich is it? Are you telling me the logs are clear, or are you admitting there's a history of leaks that you're trying to downplay as \"temporary\" and \"historic\"? I need the truth before I walk away from this deal.",
